{"id":"2007436816991671196","kind":"answer","title":"为什么除了中日之外，就没有国家有人喜欢二次元了呢?","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"外语习得","date":"2026-02-18","updated":"2026-02-18","votes":1901,"comment_count":99,"minutes":2,"chars":890,"keywords":["日语学习","沉浸式学习","二语习得","Anki","可理解输入"],"summary":"反了反了，我是真不知道中日以外的国家为什么那么喜欢二次元，以至于学汉语、日语的工具和教程层出不穷，而且他们学语言的材料就是二次元内容，比如一位我在写开源项目时认识的英国朋友，他最近就在学汉语和日语： 他给我发的这个视频中的工具分别是 asbplayer 和 yomitan ，前者负责根据字幕抓取动画的截图和音频，后者负责查词获…","question_detail_html":"<p>哪怕是同属东亚的韩国，也没有几个人喜欢二次元，现代韩国文化特别像欧美</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/657268425/answer/2007436816991671196","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"KwFMbk2d\">反了反了，我是真不知道中日以外的国家为什么那么喜欢二次元，以至于学汉语、日语的工具和教程层出不穷，而且他们学语言的材料就是二次元内容，比如一位我在写开源项目时认识的英国朋友，他最近就在学汉语和日语：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-3fb389e373ca973097f05cc79c35e0e7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3fb389e373ca973097f05cc79c35e0e7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1468\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-3fb389e373ca973097f05cc79c35e0e7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3fb389e373ca973097f05cc79c35e0e7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1468\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"P2zRfp0U\">他给我发的这个视频中的工具分别是 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://github.com/killergerbah/asbplayer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">asbplayer</a> 和 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://github.com/yomidevs/yomitan\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">yomitan</a>，前者负责根据字幕抓取动画的截图和音频，后者负责查词获取释义。这两个工具都有很多外国人在使用和维护。</p><p data-pid=\"vYpUvoKD\">我们汉化组翻译的日语学习教程也是一个网名叫做 Shoui 的外国人写的，他成立了一个叫做 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://learnjapanese.moe/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TheMoeWay</a> 的网站，其核心方法论就是通过沉浸动画、视觉小说、漫画、轻小说等内容来学日语：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-62ee5a7955e0500d683f8200ad3f3364.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"日语学习：萌萌二次元之路\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2005777505055967011\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日语学习：萌萌二次元之路</a><p data-pid=\"JQwL6GXf\">刚刚翻了一下他们 Discord，我去居然也有百合豚：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-c54075056aff502b67d83126a0ea67fb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c54075056aff502b67d83126a0ea67fb_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2798\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-c54075056aff502b67d83126a0ea67fb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c54075056aff502b67d83126a0ea67fb_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2798\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"DytA0upS\">另外我自己也经常逛 Reddit 上的 yuri_manga 子板块，刚刚就刷到爱素了：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-b6696083dbea2f659811e420bf5b391d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b6696083dbea2f659811e420bf5b391d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1506\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-b6696083dbea2f659811e420bf5b391d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b6696083dbea2f659811e420bf5b391d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1506\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"xzYgtthn\">之前找一些日漫的翻译，发现有些作品甚至没有中翻但有英翻，还挺震惊的。</p><p data-pid=\"QUIfyyfX\">我最近在用的一个查二次元材料难度的网站，是一个法国人开发的（我还在 GitHub 上赞助了他）</p><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"Jiten - Vocabulary Lists and Anki Decks for Japanese Media - Jiten\" href=\"https://jiten.moe/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jiten - Vocabulary Lists and Anki Decks for Japanese Media - Jiten</a><p data-pid=\"nH-XYxh0\">经典日语入门材料之《擅长调情的西片太太》（bushi</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-a21acb30dcac37ce0c9c1c644d4ed405\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a21acb30dcac37ce0c9c1c644d4ed405_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2310\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-a21acb30dcac37ce0c9c1c644d4ed405\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-a21acb30dcac37ce0c9c1c644d4ed405_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2310\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"-Wt-42xj\">我最近参与内测的 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://github.com/Manhhao/Hoshi-Reader\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hoshi Reader</a> 的作者则是一个德国人，头像是初音未来：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-bf51317fe36a5eefb3beec0bc25fe1c2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-bf51317fe36a5eefb3beec0bc25fe1c2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"694\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-bf51317fe36a5eefb3beec0bc25fe1c2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-bf51317fe36a5eefb3beec0bc25fe1c2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"694\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"T7-U0EKC\">他做的阅读器也是用来读轻小说用的，提供和 yomitan 一致的体验。最近因为修了两个 bug，我还上更新日志的致谢（另外一位致谢也是国人，是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/YeOSwsG7giLuQxkcDFscUXVZn2f\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">‌​​​‍‍​​⁠⁠‌‍​​‍‍‌‬﻿​​‬​‬​⁠⁠​​‍﻿​​​‬​​‍​‬​​​‍​‍​﻿⁠​基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南</a>的作者）</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-07c89d8c64e0d5a39a936e3df7d2e3be\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-07c89d8c64e0d5a39a936e3df7d2e3be_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1488\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-07c89d8c64e0d5a39a936e3df7d2e3be\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-07c89d8c64e0d5a39a936e3df7d2e3be_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1488\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"zAnYxdfA\">另外这几年日本动漫也在海外卖爆了，制作经费也是肉眼可见的提高（赶快来看《超时空辉夜姬》！）</p><p data-pid=\"ISa4lTu8\">其他我也不多说了，给另外一个日语学习工具的开源项目交 PR 去了。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"JSI5qKgk\">也欢迎大家支持国人开发的日语学习工具（雾）</p><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"HIllya51/LunaTranslator: 视觉小说翻译器 / Visual Novel Translator\" href=\"https://github.com/HIllya51/LunaTranslator\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HIllya51/LunaTranslator: 视觉小说翻译器 / Visual Novel Translator</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"2002818500717207719","title":"日语学习指南","author":"Shoui","votes":427,"minutes":23,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"2003200028689338460","title":"30 天入门日语","author":"UsagiSpoon","votes":254,"minutes":35,"reason":"延伸深读 · UsagiSpoon"},{"id":"2003548240998597680","title":"学日语之 Shoui 方法","author":"Shoui","votes":92,"minutes":67,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"},{"id":"2005215549949514985","title":"单语指南","author":"Shoui","votes":70,"minutes":15,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"},{"id":"2005581871279519232","title":"日语学习常见问题解答（FAQ）","author":"Shoui","votes":169,"minutes":23,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"},{"id":"2004873847392974568","title":"阅读技巧与策略","author":"Shoui","votes":102,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2086519476707767126","title":"凭兴趣学好日语容易吗？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":128,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 128 赞同"},{"id":"2102462801965065232","title":"为什么好多人学日语坚持不下去？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":123,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 123 赞同"},{"id":"2014122475764601075","title":"想要做到看懂日语生肉漫画和小说该怎么做？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":50,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 50 赞同"},{"id":"2053439845024920936","title":"对于日语学习者，如何选择和开始阅读第一本日文原版书？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":102,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 102 赞同"},{"id":"2085442988537398276","title":"我要日语到达N几才能大致看懂一篇日语小说？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":142,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 142 赞同"}]}